Recommends: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Description: native tray controller for the Tailscale daemon
 TailTray is an unofficial Qt/GTK tray controller for the official Tailscale
 daemon. It manages connection state, profiles, exit nodes, common
 preferences, and optional keyring-backed automatic sign-in.
